      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "Footprint Sweep",
      "questDescription": "<b>Etienne:</b> Arcadia Robotics has found a look-alike support domain and a public phishing capture. Review what the public evidence shows, separate it from assumptions about an intruder, and recommend a proportionate response.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Etienne:</b> The public capture shows a look-alike support page and a message that failed to authenticate as Arcadia. We can report the infrastructure and monitor for related activity; these findings do not confirm that anyone accessed Arcadia's network.",
